### Aula 018 — exemplos Dev Tools / curl (índice bentoml-requests)

### Cluster
GET http://127.0.0.1:9200/_cluster/health

### Contagem
GET http://127.0.0.1:9200/bentoml-requests/_count

### Pico lento
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/bentoml-requests/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":{"term":{"phase":"slow"}},"size":5}

### Agregação por fase
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/bentoml-requests/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{"size":0,"aggs":{"by_phase":{"terms":{"field":"phase"}}}}

### Latência alta
POST http://127.0.0.1:9200/bentoml-requests/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":{"range":{"latency_ms":{"gte":400}}},"size":3,"sort":[{"latency_ms":"desc"}]}
